Bundled data, both public domain and redistributable:

* src/data/stars.json is derived from the Yale Bright Star Catalog, 5th Revised
  Edition (Hoffleit & Warren, 1991), distributed by the CDS as VizieR V/50.

* src/data/wmm2025.js contains the World Magnetic Model 2025 coefficients
  published by NOAA NCEI and the British Geological Survey. A work of the US
  Government, not subject to copyright protection in the United States.
